<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef uneven on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select and Choice rib, chuck and loin cuts unevenly steady, while the round cuts firm. Beef trimmings firm on light demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
